WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.897 --> 00:00:11.043
In spring, Little Red Hen was busy.

2
00:00:11.944 --> 00:00:13.505
She was planning for the winter.

3
00:00:14.486 --> 00:00:16.347
She decided to plant some wheat.

4
00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:18.168
"Cluck, cluck.

5
00:00:18.788 --> 00:00:20.670
Who will help me plant this wheat?"

6
00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:21.991
she asked.

7
00:00:22.011 --> 00:00:24.552
"Baa, baa.

8
00:00:25.013 --> 00:00:25.653
Not I.

9
00:00:26.213 --> 00:00:28.555
I have to rest," said the goat.

10
00:00:29.516 --> 00:00:30.460
"Oink, oink.

11
00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:31.480
Not I.

12
00:00:32.121 --> 00:00:34.801
I must take a nap," said the pig.

13
00:00:34.821 --> 00:00:41.223
"Okay, I will plant the wheat by myself," said Little Red Hen.

14
00:00:43.784 --> 00:00:46.725
When the summer came, the wheat began to grow.

15
00:00:47.645 --> 00:00:49.045
The weeds grew too.

16
00:00:49.065 --> 00:00:51.466
"Cluck, cluck.

17
00:00:52.166 --> 00:00:54.247
Who will help me pluck the weeds?"

18
00:00:55.087 --> 00:00:56.227
asked Little Red Hen.

19
00:00:59.340 --> 00:00:59.961
"Baa, baa.

20
00:00:59.981 --> 00:01:00.501
Not I.

21
00:01:00.581 --> 00:01:03.784
It is too hot outside," said the goat.

22
00:01:04.905 --> 00:01:05.786
"Oink, oink.

23
00:01:06.266 --> 00:01:06.886
Not I.

24
00:01:07.447 --> 00:01:10.750
I have to cool off in the mud," said the pig.

25
00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:17.535
"Okay, I will weed the wheat all by myself," said Little Red Hen.

26
00:01:19.176 --> 00:01:21.979
When the fall came, the wheat was ripe.

27
00:01:21.999 --> 00:01:24.141
"Cluck, cluck.

28
00:01:24.621 --> 00:01:26.903
Who will help me harvest the wheat?"

29
00:01:27.503 --> 00:01:28.144
she asked.

30
00:01:29.332 --> 00:01:30.713
"Baa, baa.

31
00:01:31.194 --> 00:01:31.834
Not I.

32
00:01:32.475 --> 00:01:35.597
I am going to a party," said the goat.

33
00:01:35.617 --> 00:01:37.659
"Oink, oink.

34
00:01:38.199 --> 00:01:38.820
Not I.

35
00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:42.223
I am eating lunch," said the pig.

36
00:01:42.243 --> 00:01:49.489
"Okay, I will harvest the wheat all by myself," said Little Red Hen.

37
00:01:50.530 --> 00:01:51.771
She harvested the wheat.

38
00:01:52.731 --> 00:01:55.994
Then she took it to the mill and ground it into flour.

39
00:01:57.315 --> 00:02:00.273
In the winter, there was very little to eat.

40
00:02:01.234 --> 00:02:04.215
But Little Red Hen had flour to make bread.

41
00:02:04.235 --> 00:02:06.257
"Cluck, cluck.

42
00:02:06.737 --> 00:02:08.758
Who will help me bake the bread?"

43
00:02:09.358 --> 00:02:09.999
she asked.

44
00:02:10.019 --> 00:02:12.840
"Baa, baa.

45
00:02:13.301 --> 00:02:14.001
Not I.

46
00:02:14.561 --> 00:02:17.543
I am too tired," said the goat.

47
00:02:17.563 --> 00:02:19.564
"Oink, oink.

48
00:02:20.064 --> 00:02:20.605
Not I.

49
00:02:21.205 --> 00:02:24.327
I want to sleep some more," said the pig.

50
00:02:24.347 --> 00:02:29.873
"Okay, I will bake the bread by myself," she said.

51
00:02:31.433 --> 00:02:35.074
When the bread was done, Little Red Hen opened the oven.

52
00:02:35.935 --> 00:02:37.855
The bread smelled delicious!

53
00:02:37.875 --> 00:02:40.096
"Cluck, cluck!

54
00:02:40.676 --> 00:02:42.716
Who wants my bread now?"

55
00:02:43.337 --> 00:02:43.977
she asked.

56
00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:46.938
"Baa, baa!

57
00:02:47.458 --> 00:02:48.578
Me, me!

58
00:02:48.858 --> 00:02:50.658
It smells really good!"

59
00:02:51.099 --> 00:02:51.899
said the goat.

60
00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:55.980
"Oink, oink!

61
00:02:56.692 --> 00:02:57.313
Me too!

62
00:02:57.633 --> 00:02:59.134
It looks delicious!"

63
00:02:59.895 --> 00:03:00.675
said the pig.

64
00:03:00.695 --> 00:03:03.738
"No, you won't.

65
00:03:04.638 --> 00:03:08.621
Whenever I needed help, you did not help me.

66
00:03:08.641 --> 00:03:13.965
I will eat it all by myself," answered Little Red Hen.

67
00:03:15.126 --> 00:03:17.348
So the goat and the pig stayed hungry.

68
00:03:18.328 --> 00:03:22.591
Little Red Hen ate the whole loaf of bread all by herself.
